From 956b2f3983154594b8834caf56c6764adade9ec9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: caca2331 <spurtcarl@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 20:08:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] build(flash-attn): compile only the kernels the Whisper
 encoder runs

WITH_FLASH_ATTN compiles 32 kernel files (head dimensions 32-256, fp16 and
bf16, split and not), each expanding into dozens of kernels per GPU
architecture over causal, even_MN, even_K, local, return_softmax and alibi
(and split, append_KV). Even with head dimension 64 alone the DLL grew from
79.3 MB to 192.4 MB, and every file costs minutes and gigabytes to compile
per architecture.

Keep the one variant family the Whisper encoder's self-attention runs:
head dimension exactly 64, fp16, no split-KV (the encoder's query blocks
fill the GPU, so the heuristic never splits there; the KV-cache path that
needs it is the decoder's, which does not use flash), and the upstream
FLASHATTENTION_DISABLE_ALIBI/LOCAL/UNEVEN_K switches. What is left out
raises a readable error instead of a missing symbol -- including a sliding
window, which the disabled local switch would otherwise ignore silently.
---
 CMakeLists.txt                                | 70 +++----------------
 .../ops/flash-attention/static_switch.h       | 37 ++++------
 src/ops/flash_attention_gpu.cu                | 14 +++-
 3 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 89 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 027d0942..b85d6122 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -607,74 +607,20 @@ if (WITH_CUDA)
   endif()
   if (WITH_FLASH_ATTN)
     add_definitions(-DCT2_WITH_FLASH_ATTN)
+    # Only what the Whisper encoder's self-attention runs: head dimension 64,
+    # fp16, no split-KV, no ALiBi / local window / uneven head dimension (see
+    # static_switch.h and flash_attention_gpu.cu). Each kernel file costs
+    # minutes and gigabytes per GPU architecture, and the full set grew the
+    # DLL by 113 MB.
+    add_definitions(-DFLASHATTENTION_DISABLE_ALIBI
+                    -DFLASHATTENTION_DISABLE_LOCAL
+                    -DFLASHATTENTION_DISABLE_UNEVEN_K)
